id: pm-case-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T21:59:24.376Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T09:35:29.253Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T21:59:29.207Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T22:16:07.198Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 19/19, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-19T02:04:17.937Z",codex-sol,"Daily Release candidate PR #18 for 2026.11.6 failed with Live publication identity disagrees. npm published at 2026-11-16T08:35:25.128Z before trusted preparation at 2026-11-16T13:59:05Z. No attestation, tag, GitHub Release or recorded workflow publication attempt exists for this intent. The protected merge matches the receipt. Read-only replay at c46a241 returns occupied and retains the historical receipt on retirement. Pin the shared workflow to v2026.11.18 with existing inputs and permissions."
  "2026-11-19T02:08:38.437Z",codex-sol,The linked release caller contract and changelog check both passed. Rollout is pending review and scheduled reconciliation.
  "2026-11-19T03:41:26.071Z",codex-sol,"Updated docs/release-caller-rollout.md and docs/scoped-npm-validation.md to the pm-ops v2026.11.18 caller SHA c46a2419c63af3b348e6b559b0733ab0d9942cc7. Pinned the package-side pm-ops dev dependency and lockfile to 2026.11.18 (previously 2026.11.14). With tags fetched, npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed. The caller tests passed 7/7, the linked documentation contracts passed 15/15, and npm run typecheck passed."
  "2026-11-19T08:36:52.955Z",codex-sol,"Round DK maps the archive install fix to 98b081e8611f22952bfe428b4d339a325d1d2826. Daily Release job 135350999392 staged package version 2026.11.19 before coverage. The README still selected 2026.11.6 and the shell assertion reproduced the failure. PR 23 updated the shared workflow references in the two rollout documents. The README now reads the package version before changing directories. The fixture uses a distinct staged version and still requires the archive to exist from the consumer directory. The focused regression, 17 documentation and revert-seam tests, typecheck, lint, duplication, and changelog passed. Staged 2026.11.19 coverage at quick depth passed 114 tests and all four 100 percent thresholds with Node 22.19.0 and npm 11.21.0. The full-depth archive exercise passed 113 tests, with the Git-dependent attestation test passing after the scratch checkout received its Git metadata. The resulting full-depth counters also reached 100 percent in all four dimensions."
  "2026-11-19T09:00:35.185Z",codex-sol,Round DL updates README install instructions for the published package and verifies each documented archive path in a fresh consumer. This change builds on the staged-archive fix in pm-case PR #25.
  "2026-11-19T09:35:23.528Z",codex-sol,"Round DL updated the registry and local archive instructions. npm test passed (114 passing, 0 skipped). npm run typecheck, npm run docstring and npm run test:install passed. All 1 README archive example(s) executed successfully in fresh consumers with the version produced by the source checkout. The changelog generation and check passed with tags fetched. Work started on the branch from PR #25. That PR landed with an identical tree, so the follow-up uses main. The three README contracts passed, and the verbatim archive commands installed staged version 2099.1.2."
